{"translation":{"id":"lif_wbt","name":"ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢ ᤐᤠ᤺ᤴᤈᤠᤰ ᤁᤢᤛᤱ ᤔᤠᤱᤜᤢᤵ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"WBT","englishName":"Limbu NT (Limbu Script)","language":"lif","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"6116919e88a76086a83bb2f30e555928fb0b93d877561f10c5d7384878062fd6","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7875,"languageName":"Limbu","languageEnglishName":"Limbu"},"book":{"id":"GAL","translationId":"lif_wbt","name":"ᤃᤗᤠᤋᤡ","commonName":"ᤃᤗᤠᤋᤡ","title":"ᤐᤠᤘᤗᤖᤧ ᤃᤗᤠᤋᤡᤜᤠ᤹ ᤜᤠᤰᤋᤢᤛᤡᤒᤠ ᤛᤰᤀᤡᤱᤄᤱ","order":48,"numberOfChapters":6,"sha256":"1c41c572af76064bf6c45947936d411065e9469d63bd3f054da5f0e408432986","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/GAL/1.json","lastChapterNumber":6,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/GAL/6.json","totalNumberOfVerses":148},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ᤐᤠᤘᤗᤖᤧ ᤜᤠᤅᤢᤒᤠ ᤛᤣᤘᤠ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["ᤀᤡᤱᤃᤠ᤹ ᤛᤣ᤺ᤰᤕᤢᤰᤔᤡᤒᤠ ᤐᤠᤘᤗᤖᤧ ᤁᤴ ᤛᤰᤀᤡᤱᤄᤱᤅᤡᤴ ᤜᤠᤰᤏᤡᤱᤒᤠᤖᤥ॥ ᤔᤏᤠᤜᤠ᤹ᤗᤠᤶ ᤏᤢ ᤔᤏᤠ ᤕᤢᤰᤗᤠᤶ ᤛᤣ᤺ᤰᤕᤢᤰᤔᤡᤒᤠ ᤐᤥ᤺ᤰᤂᤠᤱᤒᤠ ᤔᤧ᤺ᤴ. ᤁᤖ ᤕᤧᤛᤢ ᤂᤪᤡᤛ᤻ᤋ ᤏᤢ ᤂᤢᤏᤧ᤹ ᤛᤡ᤺ᤔᤧᤴᤗᤠᤶ ᤁᤢᤜᤡᤱᤘᤧᤳ ᤁᤧᤈᤥ᤺ᤰᤐᤠ ᤐᤠᤏᤢᤍᤡᤱ ᤐᤠ᤺ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢᤔᤠᤱᤅᤡᤸᤗᤧ ᤀᤡᤱᤃᤠ᤹ ᤛᤣ᤺ᤰᤕᤢᤰᤔᤡᤒᤠ ᤐᤥ᤺ᤱᤛᤧ ᤕᤠᤵᤔᤡ ᤛᤣᤃᤧᤛᤡᤒᤠᤖᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["ᤀᤡᤱᤃᤠ᤹ᤏᤢ ᤛᤥᤖᤡᤰ ᤁᤧᤘᤠ᤹ᤒᤠ ᤁᤠᤰ ᤑᤢ᤹ᤏᤢᤛᤠ᤹ ᤏᤢ ᤏᤧ᤹ᤏᤢᤛᤠ᤹ᤜᤠ᤹ᤖᤧᤀᤠᤱ ᤃᤗᤠᤋᤡᤕᤠ ᤌᤢᤶᤔᤥᤒᤠ ᤛᤣᤛᤣᤜᤢᤵᤗᤰᤜᤠ᤹ᤀᤥ ᤁᤧᤘᤠ᤹ᤒᤠᤜᤠ᤹ ᤛᤣᤘᤠ ᤁᤧᤶᤜᤠᤰᤋᤡ᤹ᤖᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["ᤐᤠᤏᤢᤍᤡᤱ ᤐᤠ᤺ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢᤔᤠᤱᤅᤡᤴ ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤩᤠᤱ ᤍᤠᤱᤒᤠ ᤕᤧᤛᤢ ᤂᤪᤡᤛ᤻ᤋᤖᤧ ᤁᤢᤗᤢᤱᤃᤢᤶ ᤏᤢ ᤁᤢᤛᤏᤠᤖᤢᤱᤅᤡᤴ ᤂᤡᤏᤡ᤹ ᤁᤧᤒᤡᤖᤡᤖ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["ᤀᤠᤏᤡ᤹ ᤐᤠᤏᤢᤍᤡᤱ ᤐᤠ᤺ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢᤔᤠᤱᤅᤡᤸᤗᤧ ᤁᤢᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤣ ᤕᤧᤛᤢᤖᤧ ᤁᤴ ᤕᤧᤶᤔᤥᤒᤠ ᤋᤠᤵᤑᤧ᤺ᤶᤒᤠ ᤀᤡᤰᤛᤠᤍᤡᤱ ᤂᤠᤶᤒᤣ᤺ᤰᤔᤥᤗᤠᤶ ᤋᤠᤱᤛᤧ᤺ᤵᤔᤠ ᤀᤠᤛᤢᤰᤗ ᤑᤠ᤹ᤀᤠᤱ ᤀᤠᤏᤡ᤹ ᤗᤠᤕᤥ ᤀᤠᤈᤥᤃᤢᤶᤒᤠᤸᤗᤧ ᤆᤥᤃᤢᤸᤗᤧ ᤀᤠᤏᤡ᤹ ᤗᤧᤰᤘᤠ ᤛᤩᤧᤖᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["ᤛᤍᤠᤍᤡᤱ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢᤔᤠᤱᤅᤡᤸᤗᤧ ᤁᤢᤔᤡᤔᤡᤍᤡᤱ ᤐᤥ᤺ᤱᤗᤖᤥ॥ ᤀᤠᤔᤧᤴ᥄",{"noteId":0}]},{"type":"heading","content":["ᤘᤣ᤹ᤛ